littlefs v2.11.2, vendored unmodified from
https://github.com/littlefs-project/littlefs

Only lfs.c is built, and only for mcu=rp2350, where it provides the
read-only image store in the internal QSPI flash (see src/vfs.c).

lfs_util.c is not part of this drop: the build defines
LFS_CONFIG=lfs_ff_config.h (see inc/), which replaces lfs_util.h wholesale
and supplies the CRC and the handful of helpers littlefs needs. lfs_util.h
itself is kept because it is where littlefs implements that hook.

Build flags: -DLFS_READONLY -DLFS_CONFIG=lfs_ff_config.h (Rules.mk).

See LICENSE.md (BSD-3-Clause), reproduced in the top-level COPYING.
